OL,3,GNEWSAGrooming gang victim was offered
OL,4,Agift to drop case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a member of a grooming
OL,7,Fgang offered a teenage victim a "gift"
OL,8,Fto have "pity" and drop the case
OL,9,Fagainst his son, a court has heard.
OL,11,FHuzaefa Alaboud and three others were
OL,12,Fjailed in 2024 for sexual offences
OL,13,Fagainst girls in Newcastle committed
OL,14,Fseveral years earlier, the city's crown
OL,15,Fcourt heard.
OL,17,FAlaboud's friend Abdullah Kalzli and
OL,18,Ffather Ahmad Alaboud called the victim,
OL,19,Fwho was 13 when she was abused by the
OL,20,Fgang, to implore her to withdraw her
OL,21,Fstatements.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
