OL,3,GNEWSAGrooming gang victim was offered
OL,4,Agift to drop case
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhmad Alaboud, a 59-year-old asylum
OL,7,Fseeker from Syria, and Kalzli, 21, both
OL,8,Fliving in Throckley, admitted
OL,9,Fattempting to pervert the course of
OL,10,Fjustice and were jailed for 10 months
OL,11,Fand nine months respectively.
